      "a": "Electric Boat has $11.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The company received 333 awards in the current fiscal-year-to-date period, with an average award size of $34.8M. Year-by-year obligations include $8.7B in FY21, $9.4B in FY22, $10.8B in FY23, $8.6B in FY24, and $21.4B in FY25."
